WEBVTT

00:00:00.378 --> 00:00:09.679
Training gets new hires up to speed, and keeps everyone’s certifications current. In this video, you’ll see a course, the team view, and certifications.

00:00:10.706 --> 00:00:20.263
Open Training. Courses are made of lessons, quizzes, and sign-offs by a manager who watched. Start from the ready-made new hire course, or write your own.

00:00:21.282 --> 00:00:28.109
A new hire works through their course on a phone or a computer, one lesson at a time, and answers the quiz at the end.

00:00:29.139 --> 00:00:36.904
Team shows managers who needs attention first: overdue courses, and cards that are missing, expired, or expiring soon.

00:00:37.934 --> 00:00:50.329
Everyone adds their own cards, like a food handler card, in My training, and Worklynq warns before they expire. A manager can’t schedule a shift for someone whose required card will have expired.
